WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:03,650
A bottle of wine among flowers

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,650
Alone without emotion

3
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,650
Go call Fang Yang up.

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:13,740
Which of you

5
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,830
That upper face outside

6
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:17,830
It's nonsense you wrote

7
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:18,830
No need to ask

8
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:19,830
Was it written by me or could it have been written by you?

9
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:22,830
How dare the court speak to the emperor like this?

10
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,830
I guess this prodigal will be slaughtered.

11
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:26,830
It’s the first time I’ve seen that title

12
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:27,830
Does it have a name?

13
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:30,830
I call him Thin Gold Iron

14
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:31,990
Is there anything else?

15
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:32,990
It's okay, I'll go back first

16
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:33,990
Very busy

17
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:41,850
You should call Zhang Ruyi

18
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,850
what's going on

19
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:43,850
Just say it

20
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:44,850
No need to cover up

21
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,520
The matter of using Pinghou

22
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:52,700
But why did I help you?

23
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,770
Do you believe it or not?
